Require Import BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.
Require Import BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.
Require Import BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_observed.
Set Printing Depth 100000.
Set Printing Width 120.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_inputs_valid". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_inputs_valid.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_stack_rotate". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_stack_rotate.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_allocates". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_allocates.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.borrowed_stack_foot_cases". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.borrowed_stack_foot_cases.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.borrowed_rhs_unstack". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.borrowed_rhs_unstack.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.eval_scalar_mul_borrowed_inplace". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.eval_scalar_mul_borrowed_inplace.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_TYPE BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_observed.eval_scalar_mul_borrowed_inplace_observed". exact I. Qed.
Check BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_observed.eval_scalar_mul_borrowed_inplace_observed.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_DEF BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_inputs". exact I. Qed.
Print BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_alloc.scalar_mul_borrowed_inputs.
Goal True. idtac "BORROWED_FUNCTION_DEF BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.scalar_mul_borrowed_rhs". exact I. Qed.
Print BorrowFC.jet_secp_scalar_mul_borrowed_function.scalar_mul_borrowed_rhs.
